><i class="bi bi-printer text-success fs-5"></i> <span data-key="printable_voucher_cards">Printable Voucher Cards</span> <span id="voucherBatchCount" class="badge bg-success ms-2">0</span></div><div class="card-body" id="voucherPrintArea"><div class="text-center py-5 text-muted">Generate a voucher batch to preview printable cards.</div></div></div></div></div></section>');
